    <node id="brown armchair">
      <data key="d0">brown armchair</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The brown armchair is a cozy seating option characterized by its warm brown color. It features a plush design with a curved backrest, specifically crafted for comfort and relaxation. This makes it an inviting choice for any space where relaxation is a priority.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"sit;rest"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The brown armchair is a cozy piece of furniture featuring a plush cushion, which enhances its comfort. It is positioned near a dark-colored wall or curtain and is located to the left in the foreground of the indoor living room environment. The armchair significantly contributes to the overall warmth and inviting atmosphere of the space, making it an appealing seating option for relaxation.</data>
