    <node id="Kitchen">
      <data key="d0">Kitchen</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">The Kitchen is a designated area within a home specifically designed for cooking and food preparation. It is a central hub for various culinary activities, functioning both as a common area and a practical living space. Essential to meal preparation, the Kitchen is equipped with a range of elements and appliances, including cabinets, counters, and areas for food storage, all crucial for efficiently managing cooking tasks. This spatial area emphasizes its significance as the primary location where food is prepared, underscoring its vital role in the domestic environment and its importance as a dedicated space for culinary work.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for cooking;"N/A";eating;gathering.";washing</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen is a functional and essential space in the home, primarily dedicated to cooking and food preparation, making it the heart of culinary activities. It serves as a global location where the user is situated, allowing for observations and interactions within this vital area. The Kitchen features an array of tools and appliances, including sinks, drawers, a refrigerator, and cabinets, underscoring its significant role in domestic life.

Aesthetically, the Kitchen is often characterized by a dark, smooth countertop set against neutral or light-colored walls, creating an attractive and functional workspace. Its organized layout supports efficient navigation, enabling individuals to easily move between different appliances and observe various objects, particularly around the sink area where many culinary tasks are performed.

In addition to its primary cooking functions, the Kitchen also includes elements such as the Left Counter and Right Counter, and it may even accommodate a couch, contributing to a versatile environment for daily activities. Overall, the Kitchen is not only a central hub for culinary actions but also enhances food organization and daily household tasks, reinforcing its importance in the domestic setting.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-5b0b76960b97861a35c90e0b690109b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f4c860f4e0a24a098668b16d32d0ceb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf34c6a958b339208ad3a08c0ce1da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbc9e5b1a99517c95fb6c76a1254a379&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-88d09cfcfcedc2adcc16d0314fe78275&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-31e979835f2804ff8d1ce116dbce00c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ca4bc8bccdf736abb2732024b3d6b6b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b89e749b87de9bd2b695656376100b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3bc1c91eadc47a11af404b983abb2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679a0eca9dc0e5e9a48835d7ff7c466a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd0f8cd733e3a8c8ba2e17fdc4e0b68&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-177fe53d62cd8f8a4738a850efb9bf13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf0b30ba83e298b755bb648e6079e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b53e4715d0fd6b6527a9cb079b06d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21781aa47fdef07c741fafc0daf56d42&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9649295b1c57c65b39ff8bcbd920173a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-94076792deffc3715105da0518f7c401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b6a597b9f445063e4005e101216236e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1755ee0885b26158e70eacaecd29a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5f80c3116a93720e49290acef46cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d938391f0c5ac3146df4cf04a3a65025&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3110c2c46307410294a70a5f9d323898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-273ac18b06d95c7b3abceb0025006fd4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6a9da891ede12376a00cfbf3a48e356&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61e0642e7493eaadc2d0ef8540a842ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-25e2e04b3134120f184b293556f1036b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4227f865845247f9e29eb245d9c49c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d2c0d609132b708454a6e443bb635b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6fd8274a2d1232f9f77a0ea15e523e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9289f8ca67693e3941f314811a41ed52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0459b7526159414e9c224e45d3bd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26187e3c991b49bfc7f789f4aafc93f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a8800fd5eb4780419dd640aa3c2edf</data>
