    <node id="Butter">
      <data key="d0">Butter</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A pale yellow rectangular block typically used as a spread or cooking ingredient."&lt;SEP&gt;Butter is a widely recognized dairy product that is characterized by its pale yellow color and distinctive rectangular block shape. It is typically packaged in small rectangular portions for convenience, allowing for easy use in both cooking and baking. Butter is valued for its ability to enhance flavors and textures in a variety of dishes, making it an essential ingredient in numerous recipes. Additionally, it serves not only in culinary practices but also as a spread. Overall, butter can be described as a small block of yellow dairy product that plays a significant role in enhancing the culinary experience.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be sliced;"Can be spread;"N/A";"can be spread;"cut;"slice;"sliced;"spread;can be melted;consume";cook;cut;cut";melt;melted;melting;observe";spread;spread";use as an ingredient in recipes";use as an ingredient";use in cooking";used in cooking recipes";used in cooking"</data>
      <data key="d4">"Keep refrigerated for freshness";"N/A";"Should be stored in a refrigerator after opening to maintain freshness";"keep refrigerated for freshness";"keep_away_from_children";"keep_away_from_heat;"keep_refrigerated;"should be stored in a refrigerator after opening to maintain freshness.";avoid_melting";keep_refrigerated"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Center of the countertop; On the left side of the countertop, to the left of the strawberry"&lt;SEP&gt;Butter is strategically positioned at the center of the visible countertop area, slightly to the left of the robotic arm's path. It is located above and to the right of a strawberry, emphasizing its central role in the layout. Specifically, Butter is on the left side of the countertop relative to the strawberry, which enhances its visibility and accessibility within the overall setup. This prominent placement makes Butter an easily accessible item within the countertop space.</data>
      <data key="d7">Butter is a common kitchen ingredient that is recognized for its small, rectangular form and pale yellow color. It is characterized as a yellow block of typical size for a single serving, widely used in both cooking and baking. Butter serves not only as a versatile ingredient in various recipes and cooking methods but also as a popular spread. In culinary applications, it is often placed at the center of the kitchen countertop, signifying its importance and accessibility during food preparation. Observations indicate that Butter is positioned slightly to the left of the path of a robotic arm on the countertop, demonstrating its readily available nature for various cooking tasks. Overall, Butter is acknowledged as an essential dairy product, integral to numerous dishes and frequently noted for its distinctive color and shape.&lt;SEP&gt;Butter is a key object observed by the User, located at the center of the kitchen countertop.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-54db96677933eae2def56d385069570f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a3f830c9003a2fcb1b91e91ae47a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1755ee0885b26158e70eacaecd29a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-61e0642e7493eaadc2d0ef8540a842ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcc62d13e4271cfab3b042fbaf82ff07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83791e02fffc409681757eddcca76382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191e598f72ba5bb9098d142aa877c30b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e4b89e749b87de9bd2b695656376100b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
