      <data key="d6">"Center of the countertop; Partially visible at the lower center, extending towards the bottom edge"&lt;SEP&gt;The spatula is a notable kitchen item that prominently occupies the lower right corner of the kitchen countertop. It lies flat and diagonally, suggesting its proximity to other items in that area. The spatula's right edge is slightly lower than a piece of butter and is positioned to the right of a strawberry, which contributes to the overall visual composition of the countertop. Additionally, it is partially visible in the lower center of the image, enhancing its presence in the kitchen setup. Its handle is oriented toward the viewer while the scoop remains flat on the surface, further indicating its functional orientation within the kitchen environment.</data>
      <data key="d7">The spatula is a kitchen tool observed by the User, located near the strawberry, in a resting position.&lt;SEP&gt;The spatula is an essential kitchen utensil known for its crucial role in cooking tasks, including flipping, stirring, and serving food. Typically identified as a black tool made of durable plastic or a dark composite material, it features a long, flat structure with a slender handle that enhances its versatility. In the observed setting, the spatula is lying flat on the countertop, positioned near a strawberry, with its handle often facing the viewer, either horizontally or diagonally among other kitchen items such as butter.

The spatula's placement suggests a degree of mobility, indicating that its position can change based on usage. Although it has not been observed in the act of moving, it is recognized as the designated tool for these tasks, reinforcing its indispensable nature in food preparation and serving processes. Its design allows for easy movement across various surfaces, which is particularly valuable even in scenarios involving new technology, like robotic arms for food preparation. Overall, the spatula is acknowledged for its resilience, versatility, and central importance in a wide range of cooking activities.</data>
