    <node id="Robotic Arm">
      <data key="d0">Robotic Arm</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Robotic Arm is an advanced mechanical device engineered for tasks involving grasping and manipulation. It is designed to move and assist in various operations, featuring multiple articulated segments that closely mimic human arm movements, which enhances its versatility. This sophisticated apparatus includes a gripper for improved interaction with various objects and can perform a range of tasks from simple item transfers to intricate assembly functions.

Visually, the Robotic Arm exhibits an aesthetic design characterized by a striking blue exterior adorned with white and beige details, coupled with a glossy finish and metallic gold accents. These features not only add to its visual appeal, particularly in kitchen environments but also emphasize its modern and dynamic capabilities. The articulated joints are made from tan-colored materials that facilitate smooth motion, enabling the Robotic Arm to function effectively in both simulated and real-world applications.

The end-effector of the Robotic Arm has a claw-like design, which allows for interaction with a diverse array of kitchen objects, making it an invaluable asset for automation tasks. It is engineered for multifunctional use and can operate either autonomously or semi-autonomously. With mechanical joints and a gray cylindrical gripper, the Robotic Arm enhances grasping and handling abilities, positioning itself as a significant tool to improve precision and efficiency in various settings. The Robotic Arm, partially extended over a countertop, demonstrates its capability to integrate seamlessly into everyday environments, ultimately serving as a remarkable tool in enhancing automation.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be actuated to extend or manipulate objects";"Can be used for automation in cooking;"Can extend;"Can grasp;"Can grasp or manipulate objects.";"Can interact with objects;"Can manipulate or place objects on the table";"Can move;"Can reach;"Can reach for;"Color: blue and brown;"Grasp;"Manipulate;"Manipulate objects;"N/A";"Reach out to interact with objects;"blue;"blue and gray;"blue and white;"can assist in gripping;"can grasp;"can interact with objects;"can lift;"can manipulate objects;"can manipulate or place objects";"can move;"can perform actions such as lifting;"can potentially grasp;"can reach for;"engage_with_objects;"extend;"grasp;"grasp";"grip;"interact;"interact with kitchen objects;"interact with objects;"interact with objects";"lift;"manipulate;"manipulate items;"manipulate objects;"metallic;"move;"move";"navigate;"operating;"pick up;"pick up items";"position;"position_for_grasping;"reach;"transferred;"used for manipulation tasks";&lt;|N/A|&gt;"N/A";Details: mechanical with visible joint and segment details";State: extended toward the sink;activate";assist in food preparation";assist in observations";assist with food preparation";assist";brown gripper;brown";can assist in manipulating objects";can interact with objects";can manipulate;can manipulate objects";can move;can move or manipulate objects";control;control";controlled";execute actions";grasp;grasp";grip;grip items;grip objects;hold objects";hold";holding a yellow rectangular object";inspect or interact with objects nearby";interact with kitchen items";interact with nearby objects.";interact with objects nearby";interact with objects";interact";interacting with kitchen items";lift;manipulate;manipulate items";manipulate objects;manipulate objects in its environment.";manipulate objects";manipulate";manipulated;manipulating objects";manipulative";mechanical;mechanical and industrial";move;move objects";move";navigate;navigate";observe;observe";orange end effector";perform actions;perform automated tasks";perform tasks automatically";perform tasks";pick;pick objects;pick up;pick_up_objects";pivot";position;position";reach;rotate;white</data>
      <data key="d4">"Depends on programming and power supply;"Limited by its programming;"Limited range of motion;"Must be used in a controlled environment;"N/A";"Requires programming and power supply to operate";"depends on programmed functions;"depends on programming and power supply;"inactive state (no motion observed)";"inactive";"keep_away_from_children";"must be accurately controlled;"must be used in a controlled environment;"must_align_with_objects;"recognition_issues;"requires power source and programming;"requires power source and programming";"requires_power_source;limited by weight or shape of items";limited_access_due_to_surroundings";may be dangerous if malfunctioning";may be sensitive";may have restrictions on weight and types of items it can handle.";may_be_dangerous_if_malfunctioning";may_have_limited_range";needs_functional_mechanisms";operational boundaries;physical environment's access.";physical limits based on design";requires power source for operation"</data>
      <data key="d5">The Robotic Arm is positioned on the countertop in the upper right area of the image, next to a wrench. Currently, the arm is inactive and static, indicating that it is not engaged with any surrounding objects at the moment. Despite its dormant state, the Robotic Arm is prepared for operation, which suggests readiness for future movements and interactions. While specific details regarding its functionalities and capabilities are limited, the arm's positioning hints at potential opportunities for upcoming activities, particularly involving nearby objects, such as a sofa. Overall, the Robotic Arm appears poised for motion, indicating a likelihood of interactions with its environment in the near future.</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated kitchen device located in a strategic position on the upper right side of a blue countertop, adjacent to the kitchen sink. It stands vertically and slightly elevated, extending outward towards the central area of the countertop to enhance its interaction capabilities with various kitchen items. Although currently inactive, the Robotic Arm is designed to assist with a range of kitchen tasks, thereby increasing the overall functionality of the kitchen environment.

Equipped with a metallic gripper as its end-effector, the Robotic Arm can effectively manipulate a variety of kitchen tools and ingredients. Its relevance is accentuated by its proximity to common kitchen objects, including a stick of butter, a wrench, a pear, and a hammer, arranged in a cluttered setup. The arm is also visually positioned near a black sphere and a sink, showcasing its potential for performing multiple kitchen functions.

Despite being poised over the counter and not actively engaged with any items at the moment, the design of the Robotic Arm is optimized for seamless interaction within the kitchen. Additionally, it is mentioned that the arm's visibility extends near a sofa, although this detail is secondary to its primary role in enhancing kitchen efficiency. Overall, the Robotic Arm's capability to facilitate a variety of kitchen operations is highlighted through its strategic positioning and functional capabilities.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Robotic Arm is a sophisticated mechanical device specifically engineered for automation tasks, particularly in kitchen environments. It features a visually striking design, predominantly in blue and gray, with accents of white, beige, tan, silver, orange, and gold. Typically positioned above dark-colored countertops or a blue table, this advanced appendage is prepared to interact with various culinary items, including kitchen appliances and furniture such as gray cabinets, chairs, sofas, and wooden tables.

Equipped with multiple articulated joints, the Robotic Arm can execute a wide array of precise movements essential for manipulating diverse food items and tools. It enhances kitchen operations by assisting in food preparation and adeptly grasping objects, such as a green pear and a small rectangular yellow item. However, it faces limitations when handling certain items like an orange and a spatula, indicating variations in its control accuracy based on the characteristics of different objects.

Functioning autonomously, the Robotic Arm often hovers above surfaces, extending its reach toward various cooking tools, which emphasizes its vital role in modern culinary practices. As an actively utilized object designed for navigating and interacting with its environment, it not only improves efficiency and convenience in the kitchen but is also recognized as a key component in the realm of kitchen robotics. Furthermore, it serves as an interactive object for embodied agents, facilitating the execution of numerous culinary tasks and reinforcing its significance in the ever-evolving landscape of kitchen technology.</data>
