      <data key="d7">The orange is a small, bright round fruit that initially resided on the TV stand before being moved to the kitchen sink. During an attempt to relocate the orange, it became the focus of attention as efforts were made to find and move it to a different location. However, this task was not completed, and now the orange is situated in the kitchen sink, where it is obscured from view and obstructs direct access for retrieval. The orange serves as a target object for the agent, who intended to retrieve it not only from the TV stand but also from the right counter. Ultimately, despite being intended for retrieval, the orange remains in the kitchen sink, representing an object of interest that the agent was unable to successfully move.</data>
