      <data key="d0">TV stand</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The TV stand is a piece of furniture specifically designed to support a television and associated equipment. It features two cabinets that are adorned with glass doors and grid-like patterns, providing both functionality and aesthetic appeal. The furniture is characterized by its blue color, adding a stylish touch to any living space. Overall, the TV stand serves as a practical and decorative piece for organizing and displaying television and media accessories.</data>
