    <node id="sink">
      <data key="d0">sink</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A sink is a basin used for washing; it's the central appliance in a kitchen."&lt;SEP&gt;A sink is a plumbing fixture essential for washing and cleaning, serving as a crucial focal point in both kitchens and bathrooms. It typically consists of a basin designed for various purposes, including washing dishes, food items, and hands, and is often equipped with a faucet to facilitate the washing process. Sinks are commonly constructed from materials such as stainless steel, known for its metallic finish, lightweight properties, and durability. The design of a sink often features a gray metallic appearance, which enhances its functionality and aesthetic integration into modern kitchen environments. Additionally, sinks can be utilized in various contexts, including as a placement for items, showcasing their versatility and importance in everyday tasks.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"clean;"contain;"hold;block;contain";drain";fill;hold</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
