    <node id="perception update">
      <data key="d0">perception update</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The term "perception update" refers to an event type that signifies a change or update in sensory or observational information. It occurs at the moment of receiving new information about the location of objects and involves an observation-based update concerning the state of the environment or objects. This type of update is particularly relevant during interactions, as it reflects the sensory observations made during those moments. Overall, a perception update enhances one’s understanding of the surroundings by incorporating fresh sensory data.</data>
