    <node id="task request">
      <data key="d0">task request</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">A task request is defined as a directive or instruction to perform a specific action or series of actions. It serves as an assignment aimed at the completion of a designated task, which can be viewed as a request to carry out a specific activity. Essentially, a task request involves the initiation of particular actions towards achieving a defined goal, making it a crucial component in the process of executing tasks efficiently.</data>
