      <data key="d7">The Left Counter is a designated wooden area located within the kitchen layout, specifically to the left of the couch. It plays a crucial role in the transfer process of items, particularly serving as the intended destination for both a spatula and a screwdriver. The Left Counter is currently empty, indicating its readiness to receive these items. Additionally, it features a left receptacle and a sink, which underscores its importance in the overall functionality of the kitchen environment. Overall, the Left Counter not only facilitates the transfer of a pear and cooking utensils but also supports various adjacent features within the kitchen.</data>
