    <node id="Right Counter">
      <data key="d0">Right Counter</data>
      <data key="d1">location</data>
      <data key="d2">The Right Counter is a designated kitchen surface that serves multiple purposes, integral to the kitchen's organization and functionality. This wooden surface is specifically intended for food preparation, allowing for various culinary tasks to be performed efficiently. In addition to supporting food-related activities, the Right Counter also provides a convenient space for placing and retrieving diverse items, which can include kitchen tools like a spatula, as well as other objects such as a toy airplane and an orange. The multifunctional nature of the Right Counter enhances the overall utility of the kitchen environment, making it not only a practical area for food preparation but also a versatile space for interactions with various items within the kitchen context.</data>
