    <node id="Orange">
      <data key="d0">Orange</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A citrus fruit that is typically round and orange in color."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "Orange" refers to a widely recognized citrus fruit known for its vibrant orange skin and sweet, tangy flavor. Oranges are characterized by their distinct round shape and bright color, which contribute to their popularity and recognizability in various culinary settings. They are often found in kitchens and are commonly enjoyed for their refreshing taste. Despite their prominent color, oranges can sometimes be challenging to spot in their environment, but they become noticeable upon closer inspection. Overall, the orange is defined by its appealing round shape and striking orange hue, making it a notable fruit among citrus varieties, typically described as small and round with a bright orange exterior.&lt;SEP&gt;"A round, citrus fruit typically orange in color and known for its juicy sweetness."</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be picked;"Can be picked up;"N/A";"can_be_picked;"consume;"eat;"grasp;"pick;can_be_eaten;can_be_stored";detect";eaten;fetch";interact;juice;juiced.";locate";move;move";moved;navigate";place";placed in different locations.";retrieve";use as flavoring"</data>
