      <data key="d2">"A miniature model of an airplane, often used as a child's toy."&lt;SEP&gt;The Toy Airplane is a small model or toy that represents an airplane, typically made of plastic or lightweight materials. It is designed primarily for play and educational purposes, providing entertainment for children. Resembling real airplanes, the Toy Airplane is often partially visible, indicating its use in games where players may retrieve or engage with it. Overall, the Toy Airplane serves as a playful representation of actual airplanes, promoting creativity, imaginative play, and providing a fun experience for users.</data>
