      <data key="d7">The Toy Airplane is a model or toy that typically represents an aircraft and is designed for various playful or educational activities. It is located on the kitchen countertop, specifically to the right of a blue cup; however, only a portion of the Toy Airplane is visible and it is not fully accessible. This Toy Airplane was significant in a task involving an embodied agent, which was supposed to retrieve it from the counter. Despite the agent's efforts to locate the Toy Airplane, it remained only partially visible and ultimately could not be successfully retrieved from the designated location.&lt;SEP&gt;The toy airplane was expected to be retrieved but was partially visible, indicating its location uncertainty.</data>
