    <node id="Refrigerator">
      <data key="d0">Refrigerator</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A kitchen appliance for storing food and drinks"&lt;SEP&gt;The refrigerator is a large household appliance essential for keeping food and beverages cold and preventing spoilage. It is commonly found in modern kitchens and plays a crucial role in daily life by preserving the freshness of perishable items. Typically featuring a textured surface, the refrigerator is designed with a cooling function and a closed door that maintains a cool interior. Serving as a fundamental means of food storage, it reliably stores food and drinks at low temperatures.</data>
