    <node id="Task Goals">
      <data key="d0">Task Goals</data>
      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">Task Goals refer to a defined set of objectives or aims intended for completion within the context of a specific task. These goals encompass various aspects, including navigation and observation tasks, and represent the objectives set for particular actions. They embody the intentions driving an action and serve as essential guidelines that ensure specific aims are achieved effectively during task execution. Task Goals play a crucial role in directing actions and facilitating the successful completion of tasks, and they include the objectives that guide actions performed by the agent, as well as the specific tasks that need to be accomplished in a given scenario. Overall, Task Goals are vital for ensuring that the intended outcomes of tasks are met.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Task Goals refer to the intentions behind the actions of an embodied agent, highlighting the critical role of observing the environment during navigation. They define specific objectives that guide the agent's interactions, such as placing a plate on a TV stand, closing a refrigerator door, or moving a pear item to a designated sofa. Task Goals also indicate the aim of navigating to a left drawer while maintaining awareness of the surroundings. Through these objectives, Task Goals provide a comprehensive framework for understanding how an agent not only manipulates objects but also engages in observational tasks, which are essential for effectively carrying out its intended actions.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-177fe53d62cd8f8a4738a850efb9bf13&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f141569c90d0dc3f466444b6898c4311&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce4f49383d443b658dbd884fe5690166&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-512c99ba00abd1351acdffc5f28ef60b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b875acc27aada74fbf5b8b08480ffe8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4efe4535ba7fd9b92fec1ad1e7648658&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf1504e51a4189248aa38fd2ee3413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3110c2c46307410294a70a5f9d323898&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-23745efea012edbe0cdbde575e6dd39e</data>
