      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The sofa is referenced in the context of its placement within a room, described as being located at both "top left" and "back right" positions. However, the descriptions suggest contradictory locations for the sofa, leading to uncertainty about its precise positioning. The majority of the descriptions indicate "N/A," meaning that no additional relevant information is available. Therefore, while the summary recognizes the provided location indicators for the sofa, it emphasizes the ambiguity in determining its exact placement within the room.</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The sofa is an item of furniture characterized as small and brown, serving a significant role within the described environment. It is noted to be a notable location for placing a pear, which is identified as its final destination within a spatial context. While there are conflicting descriptions regarding the exact positioning of the sofa—one stating it is located at the back right of the room and another describing it as centrally situated against a light brown wall—it remains a focal point for inspecting nearby objects. Overall, the sofa is consistently recognized for its small size and brown color, making it a key element in the setting.&lt;SEP&gt;The sofa is part of the living area setup, adding to the comfort and functionality of the space.&lt;SEP&gt;The sofa is light gray and located at the back right of the room, providing seating in the living area.</data>
