      <data key="d2">"A piece of furniture used for placing objects; here, it is wooden and serves as a surface for observation."&lt;SEP&gt;A table is a piece of furniture that serves as a flat surface for various purposes. It typically features a flat top supported by legs, making it suitable for a variety of activities such as dining, working, or displaying items. Additionally, it can be considered a surface within a spatial context, which highlights its functional role in different environments.&lt;SEP&gt;"light-colored, four slender legs, reddish-pink object on surface"</data>
