      <data key="d2">Apple is a type of fruit that is typically round and can be found in various sizes and colors, including bright green, red, and yellow. A specific description highlights a round, bright green apple, emphasizing its appearance. Overall, apples are commonly recognized for their round shape and vibrant colors, making them a popular fruit choice. The repeated descriptions of apples as "round fruit" and "bright green in color" reinforce these characteristics.</data>
