    <node id="living room">
      <data key="d0">living room</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">"A space in a home designed for family gatherings and comfort."&lt;SEP&gt;The living room is a space within a home specifically designed for socializing and relaxation. It serves as a central hub where family members and guests gather, making it an important area for social activities and interactions. Typically, the living room is equipped with various types of furniture, such as a TV stand and comfortable chairs, which enhance both comfort and entertainment. Overall, this room plays a crucial role in creating an inviting indoor living environment conducive to leisure and connection among individuals.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The living room is a multifaceted and versatile environment that serves as the setting for various activities and tasks involving an embodied agent. Within this space, the agent navigated to retrieve an orange and facilitated the transfer of a pear, showcasing the living room's role in a range of interactions, including those with a ball. The living room is equipped with essential furniture, including a couch, an armchair, a sofa, a TV stand, a sink, and a chair, which contribute to the overall spatial dynamics and interactions within the area. Additionally, it contains a left counter, a potted plant, and exercise equipment, further enhancing its multipurpose functionality. Overall, the living room is depicted as a dynamic space where diverse activities occur, organized around various objects that support the execution of these tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The living room serves as the environment context where the task of moving the spatula is taking place.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-e8fe7206d4da4b1264ec81ca9a6de819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83e487c95a61038aa96df99ce4d9dd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef495c3da8ad2e873c7dd3f68549a05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8de0c8dda21f0a7bd359abef42ad2fc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e335795bdb56810ade9af1bf265d39ca&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdf9f4094ebfcd9a79a5e321661284a</data>
