    <node id="task_request">
      <data key="d0">task_request</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">"A task_request refers to a specific action or objective that needs to be fulfilled, in this case surveying the kitchen environment."&lt;SEP&gt;The entity "task_request" represents a formal and action-oriented solicitation for the performance of a specific task. It is characterized as an event type that indicates a request for a task to be performed. This entity highlights the expectation that an agent will execute the designated task across various contexts, such as in a kitchen setting where object manipulation may be required.

A task_request clearly delineates the goals and constraints associated with the task to be performed, emphasizing the directing of specific actions. For instance, it may involve instructions for finding and moving an object, such as an orange. Moreover, the nature of a task_request focuses on actions like navigating and observing, accentuating the importance of retrieving specified objects.

Overall, "task_request" embodies the essence of requesting action or the assignment of a task, which plays a crucial role in facilitating the completion of tasks and providing clarity regarding the task at hand.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"navigate;"retrieve";observe"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The entity "task_request" serves as a formal indication of a task that requires performance within a specific context. It signifies the initiation of a series of actions directed toward achieving particular goals or objectives during an embodied agent's interaction with its designated environment. The task_request acts as a directive that guides the actions or observations of the agent, detailing the responsibilities and expectations linked to various tasks.

In practical terms, a task_request entails explicit directives, which may include relocating objects like a pear to a sofa, moving an orange from the TV stand to the sink, and navigating to cabinet 5 to observe its contents. These directives establish clear objectives that enable the agent to effectively engage with its environment. The task_request initiates not only actions such as fetching, transferring, and observing items, especially in a kitchen setting, but also provides comprehensive guidelines for executing multiple tasks.

For example, a task_request may instruct the agent to explore the kitchen, navigate to specific locations (such as the sink and cabinet 5), and move items like a spatula from one location to another or attempt to pick up a toy airplane and an orange from the counter. However, it is noteworthy that while the task_request outlined the goal to move the spatula, there was ultimately a failure in this particular task. Nonetheless, the task_request remains a pivotal event type that structures the agent's interactions, ensuring the effective completion of designated tasks through clear and organized instructions.&lt;SEP&gt;The task_request is the overarching objective directing the actions within the kitchen setting.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-44c7d4402d89e167772ed7b4de4c2e2d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8fe7206d4da4b1264ec81ca9a6de819&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8ef495c3da8ad2e873c7dd3f68549a05&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-afdf9f4094ebfcd9a79a5e321661284a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-74343abbe74fb662fca49366a4533755&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49e81386ebdc9a6d8f85d441f2f0278a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8a5e48d2ff5b0e6cf0b9025d4ef04014&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-84aaf0b30ba83e298b755bb648e6079e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd7a3f830c9003a2fcb1b91e91ae47a2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b53e4715d0fd6b6527a9cb079b06d1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1058b785568123c9dd67809d1e3c64cc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9649295b1c57c65b39ff8bcbd920173a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-83e487c95a61038aa96df99ce4d9dd7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4227f865845247f9e29eb245d9c49c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4d2c0d609132b708454a6e443bb635b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8de0c8dda21f0a7bd359abef42ad2fc5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9a1e3929880811a0a5d3b7f0c6c5747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53daedf4d04d6753bedcb7a46e631c8a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26187e3c991b49bfc7f789f4aafc93f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c4f8a99c2c3feb883c8a2b6716e4e6e</data>
