      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">Banana is a long, curved fruit that typically turns yellow when ripe. It is characterized by its elongated shape and yellow peel, which encases sweet, soft flesh. This edible fruit is often enjoyed as a snack and is a popular choice in many households, frequently found in kitchens. The banana is recognized for its unique appearance and taste, contributing to its widespread appeal.</data>
