      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Banana is a notable object found on the countertop to the left side of the sink in the kitchen. While it was present during a particular task, it was ultimately not related to the primary objective and was not the designated item intended for the task. There was an initial attempt to grasp the Banana, but this effort resulted in a failed action as the Banana was mistakenly identified as the target item. Despite its prominence in the kitchen setting, the Banana remained distinct from the items relevant to the task at hand.</data>
