    <node id="Countertop">
      <data key="d0">Countertop</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">"A flat dark surface used for placing objects"&lt;SEP&gt;"A flat surface in the kitchen used for food preparation and placing cooking items."&lt;SEP&gt;The countertop is a flat, horizontal surface commonly found in kitchens, primarily utilized for cooking and food preparation tasks. It serves multiple essential functions, providing a vital space for preparing food and supporting activities such as cutting, mixing, and assembling ingredients. The countertop is integral to the overall kitchen layout, enhancing the efficiency and usability of the kitchen environment by facilitating interaction with cooking tools and other items. Its design and placement are crucial to the functionality of the kitchen, making it an indispensable element in daily cooking activities.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can hold;"N/A";"holds items;"place items;"provides a workspace;"support;"support objects;perform tasks";place items";place objects";prepare food;prepare food";serve as a workspace";serves as a workspace";support;supports kitchen activities"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The countertop serves a pivotal role in the kitchen, acting as the main surface where various items such as butter, strawberries, spatulas, and sinks are situated. It supports not only the sink but also other kitchen tools, emphasizing its importance in local kitchen dynamics. Additionally, through its global position, the countertop is essential for facilitating kitchen tasks and organizing essentials.</data>
      <data key="d7">Description not available in text.&lt;SEP&gt;The Countertop is a flat and smooth work surface in the kitchen that plays a pivotal role in various cooking-related activities. It is essential for organizing and managing tasks, serving as the central workspace for food preparation. The Countertop enhances accessibility and convenience, accommodating a wide variety of kitchen items and equipment, including tools, cooking utensils, and food ingredients like fresh produce, such as pears.

Notably, the Countertop is characterized by its dark and smooth physical traits, which contribute to both its aesthetic and practical appeal. It facilitates interaction between the user and various kitchen objects, allowing for efficient cooking processes. The embodiment of this workspace enables the observation and handling of items during culinary tasks, reinforcing the Countertop's significance in promoting an organized cooking environment. Overall, it serves as a multifunctional surface where a multitude of kitchen activities take place, making it indispensable in the culinary space.&lt;SEP&gt;The countertop is the surface over which the robotic arm is navigating and is integral to the observation scene.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-5b0b76960b97861a35c90e0b690109b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1755ee0885b26158e70eacaecd29a1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf34c6a958b339208ad3a08c0ce1da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11413516097f075e866c473f86e575f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-05b12ac4b5e7ef4ee723211268193b96&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c3bd83c5c76549d80af5d2102523481&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0459b7526159414e9c224e45d3bd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b6a597b9f445063e4005e101216236e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c3bc1c91eadc47a11af404b983abb2d8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679a0eca9dc0e5e9a48835d7ff7c466a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d518b76528dec9a818e598d9519f9420&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2663373a7c15d583525613b528aaf782&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1a0c00327c58a2daa9dcadbc0296695</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772703218</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Wrench">
      <data key="d0">Wrench</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">"A metallic tool that is adjustable, used for gripping and turning objects."&lt;SEP&gt;"A wrench is a tool used to provide grip and leverage for turning objects like nuts and bolts."&lt;SEP&gt;The wrench is a metallic, silver-colored tool recognized for its medium size and adjustable features. It is specifically designed for gripping and turning fasteners such as nuts and bolts, playing an essential role in various mechanical applications. The wrench is equipped with an adjustable mouth, allowing it to accommodate fasteners of different sizes, which enhances its versatility for both professional and DIY tasks. Descriptions highlight its shiny silver appearance, though some mention a darker, possibly weathered version of the tool. Overall, the wrench serves the important function of applying torque to secure and manipulate objects effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Grip;"N/A";"can be used to loosen or tighten fasteners";"can be used to tighten or loosen nuts and bolts";"can tighten;"grasp;"grip;"metallic;"used for gripping;adjust fasteners";can loosen";manipulate";rotate";turn;turn";turning";use</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"not_on_overtightened_objects";"should not be used on overtightened objects to avoid breakage";adjustable"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The Wrench is depicted as being centered on the countertop in the provided image. Additional information or descriptions related to the Wrench are not available, as the remaining entries noted as "N/A."</data>
      <data key="d6">"Global position: Left side of the counter; Local relations: Positioned flat on the counter, horizontally relative to the hammer and pear."&lt;SEP&gt;The wrench is a tool that is prominently positioned on the left side of the countertop, specifically lying flat and horizontally in relation to other tools such as the hammer and the pear. It is strategically located closer to the sink, emphasizing its placement in a manner that aligns with the center-right area of the countertop. This specific arrangement of the wrench, being to the left of the pear, contributes to a cohesive and organized layout of tools on the counter.&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Wrench is a medium-sized, adjustable metallic tool primarily designed for gripping and turning various fasteners, especially nuts and bolts. It is characterized by its darker silver metallic color, although there may be slight variations in hue based on individual observations. The Wrench is typically placed on the kitchen countertop, where it lies flat and is readily accessible for potential use. 

Observations regarding its placement have noted inconsistencies; it has been described as being centered on the counter, slightly to the right, or to the left of items such as an apple or a pear. Despite these discrepancies in position, it is consistently recognized as a key kitchen utensil, often found near the sink among other essential tools. In recent observations, the Wrench was noted to be unused, highlighting its role as a practical yet dormant tool within the kitchen setup. The tool features a movable jaw, further emphasizing its functionality in adjusting fittings or fixtures.&lt;SEP&gt;The wrench is a metallic open-ended tool designed for efficient gripping and turning of nuts and bolts, arranged on the kitchen counter.&lt;SEP&gt;The wrench is described as lying flat on the countertop and is metallic in construction.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-a43c0038cb33aa953ea92fe00f539c77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9bf34c6a958b339208ad3a08c0ce1da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4227f865845247f9e29eb245d9c49c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-faf1504e51a4189248aa38fd2ee3413b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f0459b7526159414e9c224e45d3bd9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ddc5f0966c1173fb9dc699dcc5a35590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-842e2fbd96c01331a0e8b984f377b9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-894e51b179dc3786ecfcad07007e4b1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-679a0eca9dc0e5e9a48835d7ff7c466a</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
