      <data key="d0">Dark Surface</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Dark Surface is a flat area resembling a countertop that serves as the foundational base for various tasks and supportive activities. This surface is characterized by its dull color and potentially unique material properties, which not only contribute to its overall appearance but also suggest specific color and material attributes. It is described by its lighting conditions and plays a crucial role in the interactive environment, as it provides a setting where various objects, such as a pear and a hammer, can be placed. Overall, the Dark Surface is essential for the activities occurring upon it, blending functionality with aesthetic qualities.</data>
