    <node id="Chair">
      <data key="d0">Chair</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">The chair is a light beige, upholstered piece of furniture designed for sitting, featuring a smooth surface that suggests a plush texture. It is characterized by its curved backrest, which enhances both comfort and design. The chair has a rounded shape and is prominently placed to the right of the TV stand, contributing to its aesthetic appeal within the room. It is located in the corner, making it a focal point of the space. While there is also a mention of a light gray chair positioned near the TV stand, the primary emphasis remains on this light beige chair, highlighting its functionality and stylish presence in the room. Overall, it serves as an elegant and comfortable seating option.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"interact;"sit;"used for sitting";interact;interact";navigate";observe;observe";pull";push</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
