    <node id="Black Spatula">
      <data key="d0">Black Spatula</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Black Spatula is a versatile kitchen utensil typically used for flipping, serving, spreading, or mixing items in cooking. Recognized for its distinctive black color and construction from non-metal materials, it features a wide flat blade that enhances its practicality. This spatula is designed with a handle that allows for easy manipulation, making it ideal for turning food during the cooking process. It is an essential tool for various cooking tasks, particularly for flipping or serving food items effectively.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Can be used for flipping;"Can be used to turn;"N/A";"can be used to turn;"flip;"turn food";"use;flip;mix food";scooping food";serve;serve";serving;stir</data>
      <data key="d4">"Avoid high heat if made of plastic/silicone";"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"bottom of the image;near the strawberry, pointing away from all objects"&lt;SEP&gt;The Black Spatula is positioned on a kitchen counter, specifically lying flat and oriented diagonally. The handle of the spatula points toward the lower left corner of the counter, while the head of the spatula is directed towards a strawberry placed nearby. Its location is described as being at the bottom of the image, emphasizing its close proximity to the strawberry and its distinct orientation away from other objects on the counter. The summary highlights the clear visual relations between the Black Spatula and the strawberry, while acknowledging that some descriptions included do not contribute additional context.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Black Spatula is a versatile kitchen utensil known for its functionality in cooking and serving food. This flat cooking instrument is constructed from non-metal materials, making it particularly suitable for various kitchen environments. It is characterized by its distinctive black color and matte finish, which adds to its aesthetic appeal. The Black Spatula is designed with an ergonomic handle that facilitates easy handling during a range of cooking activities, including flipping and turning a variety of foods.

Recent observations suggest that the Black Spatula has been actively utilized in the kitchen, indicating its current relevance and importance in kitchen tasks. It is typically positioned at the lower center of the kitchen counter, highlighting its accessibility and frequent use. Overall, the Black Spatula serves as a practical tool, making it an essential item in any kitchen setup.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-26187e3c991b49bfc7f789f4aafc93f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-191e598f72ba5bb9098d142aa877c30b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cb5f80c3116a93720e49290acef46cc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-91704b2974dfe887dc964702675320e7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-54db96677933eae2def56d385069570f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-11413516097f075e866c473f86e575f8</data>
