    <node id="strawberry">
      <data key="d0">strawberry</data>
      <data key="d1">item</data>
      <data key="d2">The strawberry is a small, vibrant red fruit that is widely recognized for its sweetness and freshness. Characterized by its distinct round shape and appealing size, it often features visible green leaves on top, enhancing its visual appeal. Strawberries are not only enjoyed as a delicious fresh snack but are also commonly used in various desserts and salads. Their delightful flavor and attractive appearance make them a popular choice among fruits.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"eat;garnish";slice</data>
