      <data key="d6">The Kitchen Area is characterized by a background that extends leftward from the main scene. There are no additional details or relevant information provided about this area, as the other descriptions are marked as "N/A".</data>
      <data key="d7">The Kitchen Area is a designated space where all kitchen activities take place, designed with modern elements that enhance its functionality for cooking and food preparation. This area features essential appliances, prominently including a refrigerator, which serves as a focal point within the space. The refrigerator is strategically located, surrounded by structural elements such as walls and furniture, contributing to an organized and efficient layout. Furthermore, the Kitchen Area facilitates navigation and interaction, particularly around textured surfaces and countertops, which play a crucial role in meal preparation and overall kitchen functionality. It is recognized as a specific location within the room hosting various objects pertinent to culinary activities, making it an ideal environment for both cooking and food storage.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen area refers to the overall space where the countertop, sink, and other kitchen tools are located.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen area is characterized by its structural elements such as walls and furniture, serving as the backdrop for the observed activities.</data>
