      <data key="d2">"A cube-shaped stackable toy."&lt;SEP&gt;The Multi-Colored Cube is a cube-shaped toy characterized by its vibrant array of colors, which suggests an element of play or experimentation. This small cube often serves both playful and educational purposes, making it an engaging object for users of all ages. Its design incorporates multiple colors, enhancing its appeal and functionality as a developmental tool.</data>
