    <node id="Orange Cup">
      <data key="d0">Orange Cup</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The Orange Cup is a small container specifically designed for holding liquids, characterized by its distinct orange color. It is primarily used for drinking various beverages, making it a practical and visually appealing choice for users who appreciate colorful drinkware. The vibrant hue of the Orange Cup makes it easily identifiable, and it is generally referred to as a cup that is colored orange, emphasizing its purpose as a drinking vessel.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Color: orange;"Hold beverages;"N/A";"can hold liquids;Position: near the edge of the dark countertop";serve";used for drinking"</data>
      <data key="d4">"Fragile;"N/A";can spill contents"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"on the counter to the left of the sink"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;The Orange Cup is positioned globally above the countertop and is specifically located to the left of the sink on the countertop. There are no additional local relations or relevant context provided in the other descriptions.</data>
      <data key="d7">The Orange Cup is a small, colored drinking container located on the counter to the left of the sink, positioned near the edge of the dark countertop. Its primary function is to hold liquids, indicating that it is specifically designed for serving drinks in a kitchen environment. The cup's placement suggests it is easily accessible for use when serving beverages, making it a convenient addition to the kitchen setup. Although the descriptions do not specify the material of the Orange Cup or outline its additional uses, its presence in this location highlights its purpose as a practical vessel for drinking.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-c5685800c044512697f52ce20f3f8314&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e3f723354016e94461cb895163bed9cd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7717aa9c0edd7bec036e22965a596b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b703e57f7f312079f6c2ad3c93d259e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9b53e4715d0fd6b6527a9cb079b06d1b</data>
