    <node id="Counter">
      <data key="d0">Counter</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">A counter is a flat horizontal surface typically found in kitchens, serving multiple functions. It is primarily used for preparing food and performing various tasks, offering a practical workspace that enhances kitchen organization. As an essential element of kitchen furniture, the counter not only accommodates objects but also facilitates activities, making it integral to culinary endeavors and overall kitchen efficiency.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"can be used to prepare food;"can hold items;"place items;can hold items";is used for cutting and arranging ingredients";prepare food"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"should be kept clean;may inherit wear and tear over time"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"&lt;SEP&gt;"to the left of the sink"</data>
      <data key="d6">"Global position: Central area in the kitchen; Local relations: Supports all previously mentioned objects."&lt;SEP&gt;"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Counter is a flat kitchen surface that serves as a central piece of furniture within the kitchen. It is positioned above the orange cup and located to the left of the kitchen sink, making it an essential area for various tasks and interactions. The Counter functions as a workspace where different objects, such as the orange cup and sponge, are placed and manipulated. As a generic term, "counter" refers to horizontal surfaces typically found in kitchens, emphasizing its role in culinary activities. This vital kitchen furniture item not only provides a designated work surface for food preparation but also holds various objects, facilitating numerous kitchen activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-94076792deffc3715105da0518f7c401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-842e2fbd96c01331a0e8b984f377b9eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b4227f865845247f9e29eb245d9c49c9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7717aa9c0edd7bec036e22965a596b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b703e57f7f312079f6c2ad3c93d259e</data>
