    <node id="Plant">
      <data key="d0">Plant</data>
      <data key="d1">object</data>
      <data key="d2">The plant is a living organism typically cultivated for decorative or aesthetic purposes. Often placed in various environments, it contributes significantly to the overall aesthetics. Plants are generally used for decorative purposes and require care and maintenance to thrive. An example includes a plant with green leaves housed in a white pot, enhancing its visual appeal.</data>
      <data key="d3">"Decorative;"Enhances decor;"N/A";improves aesthetics of the space";improves air quality"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A";"Requires sunlight and water;may need pruning."</data>
