      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The Yellow Banana is a tropical fruit celebrated for its sweetness and distinctive yellow color when ripe. It is not only a popular and nutritious food item but has also been noted as another content found in the sink. The yellow banana serves as a potential food source, highlighting its relevance in various contexts, including both culinary uses and incidental appearances in environments like sinks.</data>
