      <data key="d2">"Metallic adjustable tool"&lt;SEP&gt;A wrench is a metallic tool designed for gripping and turning objects, specifically nuts or bolts. This tool is typically open-ended and can be adjustable, allowing it to accommodate various sizes of fasteners. Often characterized by a dark and possibly weathered appearance, the wrench is an essential instrument in mechanical and construction work.</data>
