      <data key="d0">refrigerator</data>
      <data key="d1">furniture</data>
      <data key="d2">A refrigerator is a large kitchen appliance designed for storing food and beverages at low temperatures. It serves the primary function of refrigeration, ensuring that food and drinks remain cold and fresh. This appliance is essential in modern kitchens, providing an efficient means to preserve perishable items.</data>
