      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The refrigerator is a common kitchen appliance designed to keep food fresh and drinks cold, serving as a key location in various tasks. It is identified as the target destination for navigation, highlighting its significance in the spatial context. The refrigerator is well-known for its role in storing food items, reinforcing its importance as the intended destination during navigation tasks.</data>
