      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The task involves moving a pear item to the indicated sofa within a living room environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The task involves various actions related to moving objects within defined indoor settings. Specifically, one task requires moving a spatula from the right counter to a left receptacle, but this attempt ultimately resulted in failure. In contrast, another task successfully involved moving a pear item to a specified sofa in a living room-like environment, following an unsuccessful attempt to grasp a banana. Overall, the tasks focus on the manipulation of objects, showcasing both successful and unsuccessful attempts in different scenarios.</data>
