    <node id="embodied agent">
      <data key="d0">embodied agent</data>
      <data key="d1">agent</data>
      <data key="d2">An embodied agent is defined as an actor capable of actions within a defined environment. This entity can be either a robotic or virtual entity that engages with its surroundings to execute various tasks. It is characterized by its ability to perform actions and interact effectively within both physical and virtual environments. The concept encompasses any entity that is actively involved in experiences and actions in these settings.</data>
      <data key="d3">"N/A";"navigate";"observe;navigate"</data>
      <data key="d4">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">The embodied agent is characterized as an interactive entity actively engaged in observing and navigating the kitchen environment, particularly focusing on tasks related to kitchen and sink activities. One of its notable responsibilities includes attempting to move a spatula from one location to another; however, it faced difficulties in effectively grasping the spatula, which underscores the challenges it encounters in manipulating objects within its surroundings. Additionally, the embodied agent is seen navigating towards the refrigerator, indicating ongoing interaction with the environment. It also attempts to make its way towards the left drawer of the kitchen counter, suggesting a broader scope of actions yet to be completed, as it has not yet interacted with the items therein. Overall, the embodied agent represents an actor dedicated to dynamic interaction and action within a kitchen setting.</data>
      <data key="d8">chunk-84aaf0b30ba83e298b755bb648e6079e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f4b6af94a6822cfe2dcbf1cfd9ea301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6878dc8cc7c3d9d8b574d4ab20c10418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9a1e3929880811a0a5d3b7f0c6c5747&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0cc334f02ecda8658cd08b8999f1cf6a</data>
      <data key="d9">unknown_source</data>
      <data key="d10">1772702531</data>
    </node>
