      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Lesson learned refers to the recommendation to ensure gripper functionality before attempting further navigation.&lt;SEP&gt;The lesson learned emphasizes the necessity to ensure that the gripper is functioning properly to prevent failures in task execution.&lt;SEP&gt;The lesson learned was to ensure the functionality of the gripper mechanism before attempting to perform actions involving object manipulation.</data>
