    <node id="Home">
      <data key="d0">Home</data>
      <data key="d1">geo</data>
      <data key="d2">"A general concept representing a living environment or residence."&lt;SEP&gt;"A physical space designed for living, typically a personal residence."&lt;SEP&gt;Home is a general term that refers to a place of residence or dwelling. It represents a dwelling place where individuals or families live.</data>
