      <data key="d5">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d6">"N/A"</data>
      <data key="d7">Home is the overarching concept that encompasses the environment wherein the kitchen is located. It signifies a broader spatial context, serving not only as the geographical setting for the kitchen but also as the overall environment in which various tasks are performed. Home constitutes the overall location relevant to the navigation task depicted, providing a comprehensive backdrop for the actions described within this context.&lt;SEP&gt;Home signifies the location or environment where the navigation task is taking place, likely indicating familiarity and comfort.&lt;SEP&gt;Home serves as the broader spatial context for the task and the items involved in it.</data>
