      <data key="d1">concept</data>
      <data key="d2">"The environment context encompasses all elements surrounding the task, specifically details about the kitchen and sink."&lt;SEP&gt;"The surrounding conditions in which tasks are performed, influencing actions and interactions."&lt;SEP&gt;The environment context refers to a conceptual framework that encompasses the physical and situational surroundings in which actions or events take place. It includes the situational setting, the surrounding elements, and the conditions that affect these actions. Additionally, it provides contextual information that is crucial for understanding the specific surroundings related to the actions occurring within that context. Overall, the environment context serves as a comprehensive backdrop that influences and shapes the events occurring within it.</data>
