      <data key="d11">45.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Failure Outcome is characterized by the result of the Task Request, which indicates that the task could not be completed successfully. Specifically, the task request involved placing a plate, but it ultimately failed, which signifies that the intended goal was not achieved. This failure outcome highlights that the task request was directly linked to the unsuccessful attempt, leading to a situation where a repeated attempt was necessary due to the unmet objective.&lt;SEP&gt;The Task Request aimed to find the orange, which led to a Failure Outcome when the goal was not met.</data>
