      <data key="d17">1772701964</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Action Execution" target="Failure Outcome">
      <data key="d11">74.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Action Execution culminated in a Failure Outcome primarily due to the embodied agent's inability to retrieve the specified objects, particularly the orange. The details surrounding the action execution underscored the inherent challenges of the task, emphasizing that the failure was a direct result of the agent's unsuccessful attempts to grasp the items. Consequently, the action execution did not lead to the successful achievement of the intended task outcome, reinforcing the narrative of failure across multiple attempts. Ultimately, the execution of actions resulted in a failure to meet the task goal, demonstrating the obstacles faced in this specific execution scenario.&lt;SEP&gt;The action execution resulted in a failure outcome as the targeted items were not located.</data>
      <data key="d13">execution outcome,execution results,failure,operational failure,outcome of actions,performance analysis,result analysis,result of action,task completion,task failure,task outcome,task performance,task result,unsuccessful attempt</data>
