    <edge source="Failure Outcome" target="Action Sequence">
      <data key="d11">61.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Action Sequence was composed of a series of steps intended to achieve the specific goal of retrieving an orange. However, despite the planned approach, the execution of this sequence resulted in a Failure Outcome, as the orange was not successfully retrieved. The failure was attributed to the Action Sequence not being effectively implemented, leading to inadequate follow-through on the task. Additionally, there were repeated unsuccessful attempts, which also included attempts to pick up a pear, further exacerbating the situation. Consequently, the culmination of these efforts was marked by a clear failure, as the targeted items, specifically the orange and likely the pear, remained unretrieved. Thus, the Failure Outcome was directly linked to the ineffective execution and incomplete implementation of the Action Sequence.</data>
