    <edge source="Embodied Agent" target="Refrigerator">
      <data key="d11">94.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Embodied Agent exhibits a consistent and interactive relationship with the Refrigerator as part of its tasks in the kitchen. It successfully navigates towards the Refrigerator to observe its contents, showcasing the intelligent entity's engagement with this physical object. During its operations, the Embodied Agent demonstrates awareness of its environment by closing the Refrigerator after finding it open. This series of actions underlines the Embodied Agent's active involvement with the Refrigerator, emphasizing a dynamic and responsive interaction between the agent and the appliance throughout its tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent navigates to the refrigerator as part of its task execution.</data>
