    <edge source="Embodied Agent" target="Action Sequence">
      <data key="d11">75.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The Action Sequence pertains to the navigational task that the Embodied Agent is endeavoring to accomplish. The Embodied Agent serves as the initiator of this Action Sequence and is tasked with executing a variety of operations. This agent is engaged in a specific action sequence that involves navigating within a kitchen environment to achieve a predetermined task goal, which, in this case, includes the navigation to the refrigerator. Furthermore, the Embodied Agent actively participates in the critical action sequence of observing its surroundings, an essential component of its overall functionality. Through these coordinated actions of navigation and observation, the Embodied Agent effectively interacts within the kitchen setting, performing a series of actions as laid out in the Action Sequence to successfully complete its task.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent executes the defined action sequence during the task.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent executes the action sequence to navigate to the chair and observe the environment.</data>
