    <edge source="embodied_agent" target="kitchen">
      <data key="d11">64.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The embodied agent actively navigates and interacts within the kitchen environment, which serves as their primary operational space. In this setting, the agent engages in various tasks while moving through the area, with a particular focus on the countertop region. The agent's activities are intricately tied to their exploration and engagement with the kitchen, emphasizing a dual role of observation and action. Notably, as the agent maneuvers through this environment, it updates its perception based on its observations, further enhancing its understanding and operational capabilities within the kitchen.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent navigated to the kitchen to perform observations, indicating the agent's active role in the environment.</data>
