    <edge source="embodied_agent" target="task_request">
      <data key="d11">69.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The embodied agent is responsible for executing various instructions as part of a task request in a kitchen environment. This includes engaging in tasks that involve observing kitchen items and specifically picking up objects, such as a pear and an orange. The embodied agent operates under the directive of the task request, which requires it to take action to achieve specific goals involving both the observation and manipulation of items on a table and navigating to the sink. Overall, the embodied agent's role is to fulfill the directives provided in the task request, ensuring effective interaction with the specified environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent performs the navigation and observation described in the task request.&lt;SEP&gt;The embodied agent's navigation and observation relate directly to the task_request given to survey the environment.</data>
