    <edge source="embodied_agent" target="perception_update">
      <data key="d11">50.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The embodied agent plays a crucial role in the perception update process, particularly within the context of its interactions in a kitchen environment. It identifies the kitchen sink as a receptacle and provides updates about various kitchen items observed during its activities. The actions of the embodied agent culminate in significant enhancements to its awareness, leading to meaningful updates on its perception of the surroundings. Specifically, through its observations, the agent contributes to a perception update that encapsulates its understanding of the arrangement and characteristics of objects on the table. This reflects a notable change in both its awareness and interpretative framework concerning the environment. Overall, the embodied agent's engagement in perception updates enables it to navigate effectively within the kitchen, enhancing its interaction with the environment and the objects within it.</data>
