    <edge source="kitchen" target="kitchen sink">
      <data key="d11">43.0</data>
      <data key="d12">The kitchen is a space designed for food preparation and cooking, where various essential components are integrated to facilitate these activities. Within this space, the kitchen sink plays a critical role, as it is strategically positioned below the countertop and to the left of the stove. This placement highlights the sink's functional integration within the kitchen environment, emphasizing its importance in daily tasks. The kitchen sink serves a vital purpose within the kitchen, providing a necessary area for washing dishes, food preparation, and maintaining cleanliness in the cooking space. Overall, the kitchen and kitchen sink work together seamlessly, underscoring their interdependent relationship in the culinary environment.&lt;SEP&gt;The kitchen sink is located within the kitchen and serves a specific function related to food preparation.</data>
